mMWt59_childItem_2","label":"ggls4mMWt59_childItem_2","default":"<p><strong>Lock in essential moisture</strong></p><p>Our breakthrough hydration complex draws moisture to tissues while creating a protective barrier that prevents dryness throughout the day</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpx54hbuDa_text","label":"ggpx54hbuDa_text","default":"<p>All without harsh chemicals, synthetic fragrances, or artificial hormones—just natural, clinically-validated ingredients that replenish and maintain your body's natural moisture balance.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggftO7Vcxip_label","label":"ggftO7Vcxip_label","default":"<p>Try FloraFresh Now!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggw9tC3HKrR_text","label":"ggw9tC3HKrR_text","default":"<p>90-Day Money-back Guarantee</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwD6goUR-u_text","label":"ggwD6goUR-u_text","default":"<p>of Users Experienced Slimmer Waistline*</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbdd1kkmb3_text","label":"ggbdd1kkmb3_text","default":"<p><span style=\"font-size:px;\">In a survey of our initial customers, 91% reported significantly reduced vaginal dryness, improved comfort during intimacy, and relief from persistent irritation within the first 4 weeks.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggeeE07dckr_label","label":"ggeeE07dckr_label","default":"<p>Try MenoMate Now!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gghUr701IDZ_text","label":"gghUr701IDZ_text","default":"<p>90-Day Money-back Guarantee</p>"}],
